      "writtenOn": "2025-03-14T06:09:11Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I tried this earlier on, but I it caused problems for at least one internal user of CreateBuffer (I don\u0027t remember which one I saw crash, there are many). Those users want to DAWN_TRY to propagate errors, instead of getting null.\n\nI struggled to find any solution other than this ridiculous layering (btw, the layering is:\n`CreateBuffer`-\u003e`CreateBufferInternal`-\u003e`CreateBufferImpl`\n`APICreateBuffer`-\u003e`CreateBufferInternal`-\u003e`CreateBufferImpl`\n)",
      "parentUuid": "3610969a_0a6778cd",
      "revId": "7f15bb39b2b8036bea670db741efe151a93f80bf",
